 going on in  American restaurants at this moment and  I think if we hit those places I think  we have a pretty solid list all those  meals and trips led to their hot 10:00  restaurant list they range from classic  comfort food to new American cuisine and  stretch from San Francisco to New York  coming in at number three is mister Jews  in San Francisco number two is el ski in  Chicago and their number one pick is  Turkey and the wolf in New Orleans  Andrew and Julia welcome Nick you care  so why do you give them number one  well Turkey the wolf is this it's a  really weird unexpected choice I think  it's basically a sandwich shop stuff  that we all grew up with a bologna say  which a chicken sandwich but just  elevated and I think what we agreed on  is we had more fun eating at Turkey in  the wolf than any other place it was  that restaurant that both of us couldn't  get out of our mind they do this amazing  collard green melt that sounds so  mundane it's a vegetarian sandwich I  don't really like vegetarian sandwiches  and it was the best thing I ate this  year and it was just you know was  nostalgic it was fun it was escapism for  me well I know I want to look the paint  and lick the page when I look yeah you  guys put in but you it seems like  Chicago is having a moment Julia your  hometown yeah yeah and I not just saying  that because obviously goodbye yeah no I  think Chicago is really emblematic of  the most exciting things that are going  on in food around the country but all  concentrated in this one city this have  an amazing range of diverse types of  restaurants you have incredible Mexican  food incredible Korean food Portuguese  food all sort of coming together with  new spins and that else key you said for  desserts you described as visual  artistry yes yes I love this restaurant  this is number two on our list it's a  husband and wife he does the savory she  does the sweet and her desserts are so  gorgeous yes they are visual artistry  but they also a